Quaff a blessed potion of full healing whenever your
hitpoints dropped below about 80 or 100.  (Exactly where to
draw the line depends on what your maximum HP is and how
many potions of full healing you have left.  Your AC is
also relevant, because it determines how much damage you
are likely to sustain during the two moves it takes to get
a potion of of your bag and quaff it.)

Also, if your amulet of life saving turns to dust, take one
of the spares out of your bag of holding and put it on.

Also, if you have to break your wand of teleport, get a
couple more of them out of the bag of holding.



